cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite the paper and the data archive."
title: "Mountain uplift did not strengthen the weathering CO2 sink over 540 million years: analysis and figure code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis and figure code for a study of the erosion sensitivity of continental weathering
  CO2 fluxes over the Phanerozoic, using NeuroLEM, a neural-network emulator of the global
  landscape evolution model goSPL, two palaeoelevation histories at 109 ages, and the
  field-calibrated weathering laws of Bufe et al. (2024).
type: software
license: MIT
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-03"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EarthByte/phanerozoic-co2-paper"
